    "solution": {
      "en": "Celia used the conservator’s spare key during the 20:08–20:11 corridor blackout. The dining camera showed only her chair and a coat, not her body. Her spontaneous reference to the new blue liner at 20:13 preceded the public opening at 20:16; her prior visit explains knowledge of the old red liner only. Entry records, a uniquely numbered torn key envelope in her bag, and the watch recovered from its stitched pouch corroborate opportunity and possession. Her consignment debt supplies a motive, not proof. The remaining guests’ accounts have independent corroboration. Nervousness and facial expressions play no evidentiary role.",
      "id": "Celia memakai kunci cadangan konservator saat koridor padam pukul 20.08–20.11. Kamera ruang makan hanya merekam kursi dan mantel, bukan tubuhnya. Ucapannya tentang lapisan biru baru pada 20.13 mendahului pembukaan etalase di depan tamu pada 20.16; kunjungan lamanya hanya menjelaskan pengetahuan tentang lapisan merah. Catatan masuk, sobekan amplop kunci bernomor unik di tasnya, dan jam yang ditemukan dalam kantong berjahit menguatkan kesempatan serta penguasaan barang. Utang konsinyasi memberi motif, bukan bukti. Keterangan tamu lain memiliki penguat independen. Kegugupan serta ekspresi wajah tidak dipakai sebagai bukti."
    },
