    "solution": {
      "en": "The victims all held independently verifiable pieces of a Civic Repair Fund invoice fraud. Sloane lured them with separate document-reconciliation appointments, then transported them to W-6. The common district pattern was misleading: access to audit evidence, not geography or personality, explains selection. Authenticated messages, the van’s beacon, W-6’s lease, and the access camera link Sloane to the operation. A former partner’s angry messages were a red herring: their whereabouts and lack of access were verified. Police use the current beacon and warrant-backed surveillance to recover all three alive. Profiling generated a lead; physical and documentary evidence established the suspect.",
      "id": "Ketiga korban memiliki bagian berbeda yang dapat diverifikasi dari penipuan faktur Dana Perbaikan Warga. Sloane memancing mereka melalui janji rekonsiliasi dokumen terpisah, lalu membawa mereka ke W-6. Pola distrik menyesatkan: akses terhadap bukti audit, bukan geografi atau kepribadian, menjelaskan pemilihan korban. Pesan terautentikasi, suar van, sewa W-6, dan kamera akses menghubungkan Sloane dengan operasi. Pesan marah mantan pasangan menjadi pengecoh: keberadaan dan ketiadaan aksesnya telah diverifikasi. Polisi memakai suar terkini serta pengawasan berizin untuk menyelamatkan ketiganya. Profil menghasilkan petunjuk; bukti fisik dan dokumen menetapkan tersangka."
    },
