    "solution": {
      "en": "Milo Venn used an ordinary scheduled transmitter at the ridge relay to broadcast names from a confidential inspection roster. His company then sent false inspection summons and moved the named surveyors to a secured maintenance building to suppress evidence of unlawful dumping. The fifteen-minute lead reflected a planned sequence, not foreknowledge. Background rail chimes were reused audio: their identical waveform across recordings and bearings away from the station distinguish an audio source from a radio source. Owen traced the relay and was detained after documenting the scheduler. Signed access records, the recovered scheduled playlist, Venn’s transport orders and independent gate footage establish the operation. A current warrant-backed search locates Owen and the surveyors alive at building M-4. Historical project rumors remain unverified and unnecessary to the explanation.",
      "id": "Milo Venn memakai pemancar terjadwal biasa di relai punggung gunung untuk menyiarkan nama dari daftar inspeksi rahasia. Perusahaannya lalu mengirim panggilan inspeksi palsu serta memindahkan surveyor bernama itu ke bangunan pemeliharaan terkunci untuk menekan bukti pembuangan ilegal. Jeda lima belas menit mencerminkan urutan direncanakan, bukan pengetahuan masa depan. Bunyi kereta latar adalah audio yang dipakai ulang: bentuk gelombang identik antarrekaman serta arah yang menjauhi stasiun membedakan sumber audio dari sumber radio. Owen menelusuri relai lalu ditahan setelah mendokumentasikan penjadwal. Catatan akses bertanda tangan, daftar putar terjadwal ditemukan, perintah transportasi Venn, serta rekaman gerbang independen memastikan operasi. Pencarian terkini berizin menemukan Owen serta surveyor hidup di bangunan M-4. Rumor proyek historis tetap belum terverifikasi dan tidak diperlukan bagi penjelasan."
    },
