    "solution": {
      "en": "Adrian Kestrel diverted service payments through a vendor-identity override after ordinary procurement review. Lenora Vale moved the original signed approvals out of the audit chain and substituted copies, using a north-annex courier pouch whose numbered stub appeared in the office photograph. Its route, reimbursement and physical scan records contradict her claimed movement schedule. When Mara demanded the originals, Lenora met her in the office and killed her with a heavy document press during a documented confrontation. Continuous access footage, the recovered blood-bearing press in Lenora’s exclusive dispatch locker, matched broken components and an independently preserved audio segment corroborate that act. Kestrel’s authenticated message instructed Lenora to recover the originals and “silence the audit,” but does not independently establish that he ordered a killing; the documented evidence supports his financial fraud and obstruction, while Lenora’s physical conduct supports homicide responsibility. The executives’ real remote alibis exclude physical presence, not their separate financial acts. Miriam’s budget approval and Simon’s ordinary order entries do not prove knowing complicity in the later override. Noor’s observation opened a testable trail; no conclusion rests on exceptional intelligence alone.",
      "id": "Adrian Kestrel mengalihkan pembayaran layanan melalui penimpaan identitas vendor setelah tinjauan pengadaan biasa. Lenora Vale memindahkan persetujuan asli bertanda tangan dari rantai audit serta menggantinya dengan salinan, memakai kantong kurir bangunan utara yang stub bernomornya tampak pada foto kantor. Catatan rute, penggantian biaya, serta pindai fisik bertentangan dengan jadwal gerak yang ia klaim. Saat Mara meminta dokumen asli, Lenora menemuinya di kantor serta membunuhnya dengan pres dokumen berat dalam konfrontasi terdokumentasi. Rekaman akses tanpa jeda, pres berdarah ditemukan di loker pengiriman eksklusif Lenora, komponen patah cocok, serta segmen audio disimpan independen menguatkan tindakan itu. Pesan terautentikasi Kestrel memerintah Lenora mengambil dokumen asli serta “bungkam audit”, tetapi tidak secara independen memastikan ia memerintah pembunuhan; bukti terdokumentasi mendukung penipuan keuangan serta penghalangan olehnya, sementara tindakan fisik Lenora mendukung tanggung jawab pembunuhan. Alibi jarak jauh eksekutif yang nyata menyingkirkan kehadiran fisik, bukan tindakan keuangan terpisah. Persetujuan anggaran Miriam serta entri pesanan biasa Simon tidak membuktikan keterlibatan sadar dalam penimpaan belakangan. Pengamatan Noor membuka jejak yang dapat diuji; tidak ada kesimpulan bertumpu pada kecerdasan luar biasa saja."
    },
