    "solution": {
      "en": "Tommy Vale did not run away on 14 May 2002. Helena Rook authorized an undisclosed private placement and received a payment outside the institution’s approved accounts. Gareth Pike transported the child, then knowingly replaced his original transport statement with the runaway account after receiving an authenticated instruction to omit the journey. The original private ledger, receiving caregiver’s receipt, independently archived clinic correspondence, payment records and the director’s signed transfer authorization reconstruct the movement. With his informed consent, adult Daniel Reed is identified as Tommy through documentary continuity and an independent family DNA comparison; he retains agency over his name and family contact. Marian’s retained papers support that she was told the placement was authorized; the record does not establish her knowing participation in the concealment. Lena’s early recollection of the metal door is compatible with historic plans, but the remembered pendant is a common design she also saw in a later archive photograph. The basement was a locked records store, not a proven confinement room. Those distinctions do not discredit Lena or diminish the documented institutional failure. Surviving evidence supports the unauthorized transfer and deliberate false reporting while leaving some conversations and subjective details unresolved. The case uses no recovered-memory technique and treats former children’s experiences with respect.",
      "id": "Tommy Vale tidak kabur pada 14 Mei 2002. Helena Rook mengizinkan penempatan privat tersembunyi serta menerima pembayaran di luar rekening institusi yang disetujui. Gareth Pike mengangkut anak itu, lalu dengan sadar mengganti keterangan transportasi aslinya menjadi cerita kabur setelah menerima instruksi terautentikasi untuk menghilangkan perjalanan. Buku privat asli, kuitansi pengasuh penerima, korespondensi klinik diarsipkan independen, catatan pembayaran, serta izin pemindahan bertanda tangan direktur merekonstruksi gerak. Dengan persetujuan terinformasinya, Daniel Reed dewasa diidentifikasi sebagai Tommy melalui kesinambungan dokumen serta pembandingan DNA keluarga independen; ia mempertahankan kendali atas nama serta kontak keluarganya. Dokumen Marian yang disimpan mendukung bahwa ia diberi tahu penempatan berizin; catatan tidak memastikan keterlibatan sadarnya dalam penyembunyian. Ingatan awal Lena tentang pintu logam sesuai dengan denah historis, tetapi liontin yang diingat adalah desain umum yang juga ia lihat pada foto arsip belakangan. Ruang bawah tanah adalah penyimpanan arsip terkunci, bukan ruang penahanan terbukti. Perbedaan itu tidak mendiskreditkan Lena atau mengurangi kegagalan institusional terdokumentasi. Bukti tersisa mendukung pemindahan tanpa izin serta pelaporan palsu sengaja sementara beberapa percakapan serta detail subjektif tetap belum terjawab. Kasus tidak memakai teknik pemulihan memori serta menghormati pengalaman mantan anak asuh."
    },
