    "solution": {
      "en": "Theo Renn killed Bellamy during the courier appointment to seize his private client register and stop the exposure of Renn’s paid intimidation work. Continuous entrance footage, the dispatch-token record, Bellamy’s last recorded confrontation and the recovered blood-bearing desk weight in Renn’s sole-access courier bag establish the local crime. An unpaid client dispute supplied an alternative motive but the client’s independent alibi excludes the meeting window. Bellamy’s public ledger described service fees while his retained instructions grouped identity, laboratory and employment payments under L7N042. Those records establish a shared settlement trail, not the identity of whoever controlled the whole operation. The original register is recovered intact, giving the investigation its first durable network lead.",
      "id": "Theo Renn membunuh Bellamy saat janji kurir untuk merebut daftar klien privat serta menghentikan pengungkapan pekerjaan intimidasi berbayarnya. Rekaman masuk tanpa jeda, catatan token pengiriman, konfrontasi terakhir Bellamy yang terekam, serta pemberat meja berdarah di tas kurir akses tunggal Renn memastikan kejahatan setempat. Sengketa klien berutang memberi motif alternatif tetapi alibi independen klien menyingkirkan rentang pertemuan. Buku publik Bellamy menjelaskan biaya layanan sementara instruksi tersimpan mengelompokkan pembayaran identitas, laboratorium, serta ketenagakerjaan dengan L7N042. Catatan itu memastikan jejak penyelesaian bersama, bukan identitas pengendali seluruh operasi. Daftar asli ditemukan utuh dan memberi petunjuk jaringan permanen pertama."
    },
