    "solution": {
      "en": "Dorian Saye operated the identity service through his legitimate agency. The original death register, incompatible bearer history, authenticated approval signatures after Tess’s revocation, preserved client messages and independently reconciled payments establish the operation. Elena’s messages corroborate an attempt to escape threats; they do not establish knowledge of the network’s other crimes. Dorian’s other client files explicitly promise concealment for paid assignments and share Bellamy’s L7N042 settlement references. Original bank identifiers link the same payments across the two investigations. That verifies common administrative infrastructure without proving every client had the same purpose or identifying the parent-authority holder. The former-employee accusation is contradicted by the provider’s revocation history and physical office records.",
      "id": "Dorian Saye menjalankan layanan identitas melalui agensi sahnya. Daftar kematian asli, riwayat pembawa tak sesuai, tanda tangan persetujuan terautentikasi setelah pencabutan akses Tess, pesan klien tersimpan, serta pembayaran direkonsiliasi independen memastikan operasi. Pesan Elena menguatkan upaya lepas dari ancaman; tidak memastikan pengetahuan kejahatan jaringan lain. Berkas klien lain Dorian secara eksplisit menjanjikan penyamaran bagi tugas berbayar serta berbagi rujukan penyelesaian L7N042 Bellamy. Pengenal bank asli menghubungkan pembayaran sama pada dua investigasi. Ini memverifikasi infrastruktur administratif bersama tanpa membuktikan semua klien bertujuan sama atau mengidentifikasi pemegang wewenang induk. Tuduhan mantan pegawai dibantah riwayat pencabutan akses penyedia serta catatan kantor fisik."
    },
