      "summary": {
        "en": "Mara Vale coordinated recruitment through separately branded intermediaries, matching specific access and skills to narrowly described tasks. Signed scheduling changes, original message versions, authenticated fee instructions and the independent delivery journal establish her control. Financial hardship and threatened reputations supplied leverage but do not by themselves prove intent. Rafe knowingly accepted unlawful entry; Oren knowingly accepted an unauthorized reference transfer; Nina’s retained instruction concealed the unlawful destination and does not establish knowing participation in the broader crimes. Their different knowledge was a feature of the assignment design. Fees reconcile with L7N042, identities match Episode 02 and task requests reference the laboratory service from Episode 03. Mara could allocate approved tasks and fees but could not alter the reserved parent authority. The hierarchy therefore contains an active recruiter beneath an unresolved coordinating layer.",
        "id": "Mara Vale mengoordinasikan rekrutmen melalui perantara bermerek terpisah, mencocokkan akses serta keterampilan dengan tugas berdeskripsi sempit. Perubahan jadwal bertanda tangan, versi pesan asli, instruksi biaya terautentikasi, serta jurnal pengiriman independen memastikan kendalinya. Kesulitan keuangan serta reputasi terancam memberi tekanan tetapi tidak dengan sendirinya membuktikan niat. Rafe secara sadar menerima masuk tak sah; Oren secara sadar menerima transfer pembanding tanpa izin; instruksi tersimpan Nina menyembunyikan tujuan tak sah serta tidak memastikan keikutsertaan sadar dalam kejahatan luas. Perbedaan pengetahuan adalah bagian desain penugasan. Biaya direkonsiliasi dengan L7N042, identitas sesuai Episode 02, serta permintaan tugas merujuk layanan laboratorium Episode 03. Mara bisa mengalokasikan tugas serta biaya disetujui tetapi tidak mengubah wewenang induk cadangan. Hierarki memuat perekrut aktif di bawah lapisan koordinasi yang belum terjawab."
      },
