    "solution": {
      "en": "Ivo Hale controlled the undisclosed surveillance tasking behind Northline’s legitimate security work. Independent provider journals link his authenticated requests to private records across the four divisions; matched disclosure events precede coercive withdrawal messages. Original contracts do not authorize those uses. The targeted information differs by person, showing tailored pressure rather than a universal psychological formula. Knox identified the information trail and was detained under Ivo’s signed transport instruction. Gate footage, the vehicle record and current warrant-backed observations locate him alive at unit K-3. Finance, identity, laboratory and recruitment disclosures all carry reserved parent-account references reconcilable to L7N042. A historical delegation register shows the five divisions report to the same reserved authority, but the current working copy withholds its holder. That connection triggers a comparison with the original charter in the finale; Ivo’s operational reach alone does not identify the architect.",
      "id": "Ivo Hale mengendalikan penugasan pengawasan tersembunyi di balik kerja keamanan sah Northline. Jurnal penyedia independen menghubungkan permintaan terautentikasinya dengan catatan privat lintas empat divisi; kejadian pengungkapan cocok mendahului pesan paksaan pengunduran diri. Kontrak asli tidak mengizinkan pemakaian itu. Informasi tertarget berbeda menurut orang, menunjukkan tekanan disesuaikan, bukan rumus psikologis universal. Knox mengidentifikasi jejak informasi lalu ditahan berdasarkan instruksi transportasi bertanda tangan Ivo. Rekaman gerbang, catatan kendaraan, serta pengamatan terkini berizin menempatkannya hidup di unit K-3. Pengungkapan keuangan, identitas, laboratorium, serta rekrutmen membawa rujukan rekening induk cadangan yang dapat direkonsiliasi dengan L7N042. Daftar delegasi historis menunjukkan lima divisi melapor pada wewenang cadangan sama, tetapi salinan kerja kini menutup pemegangnya. Hubungan itu memicu pembandingan dengan piagam asli pada final; jangkauan operasional Ivo saja tidak mengidentifikasi perancang."
    },
