    "solution": {
      "en": "Celia Rook is the architect. The original foundation charter makes her the sole reserved authority for parent program L7, nominee namespace N and beneficiary pool 042: together, L7N042. Independently preserved provider events show her creating, funding and amending the pool before the divisions were delegated their narrower roles. Ownership and bank records trace diverted protected-beneficiary settlements to her controlled fund. Bellamy handled finance; Dorian supplied identities for nominee claims; Felix altered reports to protect operational actors; Mara recruited compartmentalized workers; Ivo monitored participants and applied private-information pressure. Their signed local acts establish different knowing roles, not equal responsibility for every offense. Renn killed Bellamy to seize the register; Felix killed Rebecca to suppress her audit; Ivo detained Knox, who was recovered alive. Elena’s protective identity request and Nina’s misleadingly described delivery do not establish knowledge of the full scheme. The unsigned dossier was a final obstruction attempt: Rook used restricted records legitimately supplied for response, changed the command relationships and uploaded a summary blaming bounded division heads. Original disclosure receipts and authenticated upload revisions establish that manipulation. The network began with the 2018 parent pool, expanded through identity and forensic services, then recruitment and surveillance. Its objective was diverting protected settlements through controlled nominees while suppressing challenges. Early financial references were genuine system identifiers, not coded confessions; only their reconciliation with ownership and authority records identifies the organizer.",
      "id": "Celia Rook adalah perancang. Piagam yayasan asli menjadikannya satu-satunya wewenang cadangan bagi program induk L7, ruang nama nominee N, serta kelompok penerima 042: bersama-sama L7N042. Kejadian penyedia disimpan independen menunjukkan ia membuat, mendanai, serta mengubah kelompok sebelum divisi menerima delegasi peran lebih sempit. Catatan kepemilikan serta bank menelusuri penyelesaian penerima dilindungi yang dialihkan ke dana dikuasainya. Bellamy menangani keuangan; Dorian menyediakan identitas bagi klaim nominee; Felix mengubah laporan untuk melindungi pelaku operasional; Mara merekrut pekerja dengan pengetahuan terpisah; Ivo memantau peserta serta memberi tekanan informasi privat. Tindakan setempat bertanda tangan memastikan peran sadar berbeda, bukan tanggung jawab sama atas setiap pelanggaran. Renn membunuh Bellamy untuk merebut daftar; Felix membunuh Rebecca untuk menekan audit; Ivo menahan Knox yang ditemukan hidup. Permintaan identitas perlindungan Elena serta pengiriman Nina yang dijelaskan menyesatkan tidak memastikan pengetahuan skema penuh. Dosier tanpa tanda tangan adalah upaya penghalangan terakhir: Rook memakai catatan terbatas yang sah disediakan untuk tanggapan, mengubah hubungan komando, serta mengunggah ringkasan yang menyalahkan kepala divisi terbatas. Tanda terima pengungkapan asli serta revisi unggahan terautentikasi memastikan manipulasi itu. Jaringan dimulai dari kelompok induk 2018, berkembang melalui layanan identitas serta forensik, kemudian rekrutmen serta pengawasan. Tujuannya mengalihkan penyelesaian dilindungi melalui nominee terkendali sambil menekan tantangan. Rujukan keuangan awal adalah pengenal sistem asli, bukan pengakuan tersandi; hanya rekonsiliasinya dengan kepemilikan serta wewenang mengidentifikasi pengatur."
    },
